# Simplicity first

1. Simplest correct solution wins.
2. No cross-collection joins at render time if data can live on one document.
3. One DB query beats two. Server action beats new API route.
4. Before new files/types/abstractions: "Is there a 5-line version?"
5. Reuse existing fields, models, and actions.
